{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sprint 5 - Pruebas MS-Estudiantes & MS-Instructores",
    "description": "Colección de Postman para probar los endpoints del Sprint 5. Incluye autenticación JWT y todas las operaciones CRUD.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "estudiante_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "instructor_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 AUTENTICACIÓN",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login (Obtener JWT Token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@escuela.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "⚠️ HACER PRIMERO: Obtiene JWT token\n\nRequisitos previos:\n1. PostgreSQL corriendo\n2. RabbitMQ corriendo\n3. API Gateway corriendo (puerto 8080)\n4. MS-Auth corriendo (puerto 8081)\n\nRespuesta esperada:\n{\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGc...\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 86400\n}\n\nCopiar el token y pegarlo en:\nPostman → Variables → jwt_token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Variables de Entorno (GUARDAR DESPUÉS DE LOGIN)",
          "description": "PASOS:\n1. Ejecuta \"Login (Obtener JWT Token)\" primero\n2. Copia el valor de \"token\" de la respuesta\n3. En Postman:\n   - Click en el ojo (eye icon) arriba\n   - Click en \"Edit\" junto a \"Sprint 5 - Collection\"\n   - Pega el token en Variables > jwt_token > current value\n4. Guarda (Ctrl+S)\n5. Ahora todos los requests tendrán autenticación"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👥 MS-ESTUDIANTES (CRUD)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "📋 GET - Listar todos los estudiantes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Email",
                "value": "admin@escuela.com",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/estudiantes?page=0&size=20&sort=id",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "id"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retorna lista paginada de estudiantes"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "📄 GET - Obtener un estudiante por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Email",
                "value": "admin@escuela.com",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/estudiantes/{{estudiante_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes",
                "{{estudiante_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retorna detalles de un estudiante específico"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "➕ POST - Crear nuevo estudiante",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Email",
                "value": "admin@escuela.com",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Roles",
                "value": "ADMIN",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cedula\": \"1710034065\",\n  \"nombreCompleto\": \"Juan Pérez García\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"telefonoContacto\": \"0987654321\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Quito, Ecuador\",\n  \"estado\": \"ACTIVO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/estudiantes",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea un nuevo estudiante\n\nVALIDACIONES:\n- cedula: Única, no puede duplicarse\n- email: Única, no puede duplicarse\n- nombreCompleto: Requerido\n\nRESPUESTA:\nStatus 201 Created\nHeader: Location: /estudiantes/{id}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "✏️ PUT - Actualizar estudiante",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Email",
                "value": "admin@escuela.com",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Roles",
                "value": "ADMIN",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombreCompleto\": \"Juan Pérez García - ACTUALIZADO\",\n  \"telefonoContacto\": \"0999999999\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Nueva dirección\",\n  \"estado\": \"ACTIVO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/estudiantes/{{estudiante_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes",
                "{{estudiante_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza un estudiante existente\n\nCampos opcionalmente actualizables:\n- nombreCompleto\n- telefonoContacto\n- direccion\n- estado\n\nNOTA: cedula y email no se pueden cambiar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "🗑️ DELETE - Eliminar estudiante (Soft Delete)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Email",
                "value": "admin@escuela.com",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Roles",
                "value": "ADMIN",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/estudiantes/{{estudiante_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "estudiantes",
                "{{estudiante_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elimina un estudiante (soft delete)\n\nNOTA: No borra de la BD, solo marca deletedAt = now()\nRESPULTADO: Status 204 No Content"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
